<http://rs.tdwg.org/chrono/terms/materialDatedRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "`sameAs` (cases where the subject material was completely destructively subsampled to get the ChronometricAge); `subsampleOf` (cases where part of the original specimen was extracted as the material used to determine the ChronometricAge); `inContextWith` (cases where the ChronometricAge is inferred from materialDated, such as sediments or cultural objects, in related temporal context); `stratigraphicallyCorrelatedWith` (cases where the ChronometricAge is inferred from materialDated in a stratigraphically correlated context)"@en .
